 epithelial cells decreases respiratory syncytial virus infection</article-title><source>Biochem Biophys Res Commun</source><volume>280</volume><fpage>188</fpage><lpage>95</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11162498</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b8-copd-2-477"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Caramori</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Ito</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Adcock</surname><given-names>IM</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Transcription factors in asthma and COPD</article-title><source>IDrugs</source><volume>7</volume><fpage>764</fpage><lpage>70</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15334310</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b9-copd-2-477"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Caramori</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Ito</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Contoli</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Molecular mechanisms of respiratory virus-induced asthma and COPD exacerbations and pneumonia</article-title><source>Curr Med Chem</source><volume>13</volume><fpage>2267</fpage><lpage>90</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16918354</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b10-copd-2-477"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Casola</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Garofalo</surname><given-names>RP</given-names></name><name><surname>Jamaluddin</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>Requirement of a novel upstream response element in respiratory syncytial virus-induced IL-8 gene expression</article-title><source>J Immunol</source><volume>164</volume><fpage>5944</fpage><lpage>51</lpage><pub-id